"simple commits. It does not manage remotes, branches, merges, rebases, "
"conflicts, credentials, or build workflows."
msgstr "Source Control understøtter lokal gennemgang, diff, stage, unstage, kassering og enkle commits. Det håndterer ikke remotes, grene, sammenfletninger, rebaser, konflikter, legitimationsoplysninger eller build-arbejdsgange."

